    "description": "<p><strong>Engram</strong></p><p><strong>Mind Mirage:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Far range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to project a silent image of an object or creature into their mind. They believe the illusion is real and act accordingly until they attack or physically interact with it or the scene ends.</p><p><strong>Synaptic Delay:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Close range. On a success, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to disrupt their neural signals. The target is temporarily <em>Slowed</em>. While <em>Slowed</em>, they can't act yet when spotlighted. Instead place a token on them and describe what they're preparing to do. When you spotlight them again and they have a token on them, clear the token and they can act.</p>",
